# Wang et al. (2019, ApJ 884, 30), Figure 9 (binned QLF), extracted from the vector paths of binqlf.pdf in arXiv:1810.11926v1
# Sample: 17 quasars from DELS/PS1 + UHS + WISE (y_ps1 < 21.0 main sample)
# Redshift: 6.45 < z < 7.05; representative z ~ 6.7
# Magnitude definition: M1450 (x = plotted symbol position, not the bin centre); three bins of width 0.7 mag over -27.6 < M1450 < -25.5
# Phi convention: log10(Phi / cMpc^-3 mag^-1), with asymmetric errors in dex (upper, lower); H0 = 70, Om = 0.3, OL = 0.7
# Note: The arXiv version (v1, the only one) has no numerical binned-QLF table; the published version could not be checked.
#       These values are therefore figure-extracted, not copied from a table. Axis calibration: decade ticks of Phi and 0.5-mag
#       ticks of M1450 in the PDF; they agree within 0.004 dex/mag with the independent digitisation of Shen et al. (2020)
#       (quasarlf repository, new_load_wang18_lf_data.py).
#
# M1450  LogPhi  UpperDeltaDex  LowerDeltaDex
 -27.185  -9.82447  0.119982  0.16639
 -26.440  -9.44662  0.0834825  0.103426
 -25.831  -9.0824  0.141907  0.212158
